* 3D mode 7: die 1 lifted 10, workpiece 2 lifted 3, dropped along -z (token 2 = 0.002) onto the union of the other surfaces: 'Object 2 has been dropped successfully.' (expect about (0,0,-3))
* ORACLE: 'Object 2 has been dropped successfully.', workpiece moved by (0,0,-3.001) = -(gap 3 + p15/2), net (0,0,-0.001); CNTRAX/CNTRA2 of object 2 are NOT moved by a drop (stay at z 3, axis vector 0, OBJPOS_drop.md 4 step 6).
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 10
OBJPOS 2 1 0 0 3
OBJPOS 2 7 0.002 0 0 -1 0 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
